    {
      "id": "claim_36d23f8bb95144dbb79e9603531e67d6",
      "statement": "Library version capture probes a fixed tuple of tracked scientific distributions and silently omits any that are not installed, so the envelope records what was actually present rather than failing on a missing optional dependency.",
